    {
      "block_id": "MP015:p0049:b0003",
      "text": "7.9.1 Assembly of the electric motor",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 124.68,
        "top": 109.68,
        "x1": 293.291,
        "bottom": 119.64
      },
      "reading_order": 3,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP015:p0049:b0004",
      "text": "!",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 129.123,
        "top": 128.827,
        "x1": 134.438,
        "bottom": 144.787
      },
      "reading_order": 4,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP015:p0049:b0005",
      "text": "The electric motor must be provided with a fixed bearing.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 164.34,
        "top": 133.332,
        "x1": 438.795,
        "bottom": 143.292
      },
      "reading_order": 5,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP015:p0049:b0006",
      "text": "1 Check if the axial clearance of the motor shaft does not exceed 0,3 mm.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 164.34,
        "top": 151.68,
        "x1": 482.111,
        "bottom": 161.64
      },
      "reading_order": 6,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP015:p0049:b0007",
      "text": "2 Place the motor vertically, support the shaft on fan side, so that it is pushed to motor",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 164.34,
        "top": 167.7,
        "x1": 534.603,
        "bottom": 177.66
      },
      "reading_order": 7,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP015:p0049:b0008",
      "text": "flange side and the axial clearance is absorbed.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 178.56,
        "top": 179.7,
        "x1": 379.024,
        "bottom": 189.66
      },
      "reading_order": 8,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP015:p0049:b0009",
      "text": "3 For motors up to and including IEC 112, remove the key from the shaft end",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 164.34,
        "top": 195.311,
        "x1": 537.387,
        "bottom": 205.271
      },
      "reading_order": 9,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP015:p0049:b0010",
      "text": "4 Push the stub shaft (2200) over the shaft end.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 164.34,
        "top": 211.68,
        "x1": 374.211,
        "bottom": 221.64
      },
      "reading_order": 10,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP015:p0049:b0011",
      "text": "5 Fit the 2 set screws (2280) into the sub shaft hub, using Loctite 243, till they are",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 164.34,
        "top": 227.699,
        "x1": 519.78,
        "bottom": 237.659
      },
      "reading_order": 11,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP015:p0049:b0012",
      "text": "inside the keyway, but do not tighten the screws. For motors of IEC 112 upwards",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 178.56,
        "top": 239.35,
        "x1": 535.71,
        "bottom": 249.659
      },
      "reading_order": 12,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP015:p0049:b0013",
      "text": "fit only one set screw at the pump casing side",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 178.56,
        "top": 251.35,
        "x1": 399.008,
        "bottom": 261.31
      },
      "reading_order": 13,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP015:p0049:b0014",
      "text": "6 Place the lantern piece (0250) on the motor, using the bolts (0850) and nuts",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 164.34,
        "top": 267.659,
        "x1": 497.867,
        "bottom": 277.619
      },
      "reading_order": 14,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP015:p0049:b0015",
      "text": "(0900).",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 164.34,
        "top": 283.678,
        "x1": 196.241,
        "bottom": 293.638
      },
      "reading_order": 15,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
